# xxCar_MCU / FMUv6C config (Stage 2 - Task 1: buses + sensor discovery)
#
# Console : NSH shell on TELEM1 (UART7, PE7/PE8) @115200 8N1.
# Logging : syslog -> BOTH the TELEM1 console (live) AND RAMLOG (/dev/ramlog),
#           readable after boot with `cat /dev/ramlog` or `dmesg`.
# Buses   : I2C4 (internal: MS5611+IST8310+EEPROM), I2C2 (external), SPI1 (IMUs).
# USB     : CDC-ACM raw data port /dev/ttyACM0 (VID 0x3162/PID 0x0053).
# Float/libc: full float + libc extension set enabled up front.
#
# Regenerate after menuconfig with:  make -C deps/nuttx savedefconfig
#
# CONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_COMMON is not set
# CONFIG_NSH_DISABLE_IFCONFIG is not set
# CONFIG_NSH_DISABLE_PS is not set
